  "title": "AMETEK MOCON® Launches New Small Volume Modules for Dansensor® CheckMate 4",
  "summary": "AMETEK MOCON, the global leader in gas measurement solutions, has introduced two new Small Volume modules for its industry-leading Dansensor CheckMate 4 headspace gas analyzer. These modules are engineered to deliver precise oxygen measurement in packaging with extremely limited headspace – an increasingly critical need across industries.",
